  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d01fd2d64a9249049aaa77d5c12a82fe, type: 3}
  m_Name: Question 24
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  questionText: The iodine-starch complex changes the colour of the solution. Hence,
    starch acts as_______.
  referenceImage: {fileID: 0}
  explanationText: The starch solution acts as an indicator. The iodine combines
    with the amylose present in the starch that gives blue colour.
  options:
  - a reducing agent
  - an oxidising agent
  - an indicator
  - All of the Above
  correctOptionIndex: 2
